piper_phonemize.mjs
  The loader for Piper's phonemizer, from the npm package @diffusionstudio/piper-wasm 1.0.0
  (MIT), with one line added to export it as a module. The phonemizer itself and its language
  data are espeak-ng (GPL-3.0); they are not kept here but fetched from the package's CDN copy
  when a voice is first used. https://github.com/rhasspy/piper-phonemize

The voice models are fetched from https://huggingface.co/rhasspy/piper-voices; each has its own
licence, named beside it in neural.js.
